{
  "source": "Chromium 141.0.7390.37, Linux, Playwright 中打开 https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API/Using_Fetch，选中 #reading_the_response_body 到 section:has(> #reading_the_response_body) > p:last-child 后 Ctrl+C",
  "types": {
    "text/plain": "Reading the response body\nThe Response interface provides a number of methods to retrieve the entire body contents in a variety of different formats:\n\nResponse.arrayBuffer()\nResponse.blob()\nResponse.formData()\nResponse.json()\nResponse.text()\nThese are all asynchronous methods, returning a Promise which will be fulfilled with the body content.\n\nIn this example, we fetch an image and read it as a Blob, which we can then use to create an object URL:\n\njs\n\nCopy\nconst image = document.querySelector(\"img\");\n\nconst url = \"flowers.jpg\";\n\nasync function setImage() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(url);\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      throw new Error(`Response status: ${response.status}`);\n    }\n    const blob = await response.blob();\n    const objectURL = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n    image.src = objectURL;\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.error(e);\n  }\n}\nThe method will throw an exception if the response body is not in the appropriate format: for example, if you call json() on a response that can't be parsed as JSON.",
    "text/html": "<h3 id=\"reading_the_response_body\" class=\"heading\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API/Using_Fetch#reading_the_response_body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none;\">Reading the response body</a></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The<span> </span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response</code><span> </span>interface provides a number of methods to retrieve the entire body contents in a variety of different formats:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Response/arrayBuffer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response.arrayBuffer()</code></a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Response/blob\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response.blob()</code></a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Response/formData\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response.formData()</code></a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Response/json\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response.json()</code></a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Response/text\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Response.text()</code></a></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">These are all asynchronous methods, returning a<span> </span><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Promise</code></a><span> </span>which will be fulfilled with the body content.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">In this example, we fetch an image and read it as a<span> </span><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Blob\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(4, 76, 159); text-decoration: underline;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(237, 238, 240); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;\">Blob</code></a>, which we can then use to create an object URL:</p><mdn-code-example class=\"brush: js notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 1rem 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"code-example\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; --border: 1px solid light-dark(#c3c7cb,#51565d); border-color: rgb(195, 199, 203); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 0.25rem; overflow: hidden;\"><div class=\"example-header\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(195, 199, 203); display: flex; line-height: 1; min-height: 3.1rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem 1rem; gap: 0.5rem;\"><span class=\"language-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: auto;\">js</span><mdn-copy-button variant=\"secondary\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><mdn-button variant=\"secondary\" style=\"display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle;\"><button class=\"button\" part=\"button\" aria-labelledby=\"label-4yz0gry9cw6\" data-variant=\"secondary\" style=\"align-items: center; background-color: initial; border: 1px solid currentcolor; border-radius: 0.25rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); column-gap: 0.3125em; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; fon